<title>USA: Pacific Summa signs Argentina distributor.</title>
<headline>Pacific Summa signs Argentina distributor.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNT SINAI, N.Y. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pacific Summa Environmental Corp said on Wednesday it signed an agreement appointing Ecosistema Biotica SA as Pacific's exclusive distributor in Argentina and the countries that constitute the Mercosur, including Chile and Bolivia.</p>
<p>The agreement requires Ecosistema to buy $500,000 of Pacific's product line in the first 12 months, and to attain a 10 percent market share to maintain exclusivity.</p>
<p>Pacific Summa provides environmental goods and services.</p>
</text>
